  "abstract": "This is a re-submission of the Delta-Space MoE concept, correcting a critical bug in the previous attempt (ID 147). The model is trained to predict the *change* (delta) from the last input state via a custom loss function. This version's forward pass now correctly adds the predicted delta back to the last input state, reconstructing an absolute forecast for the evaluation system. This is a valid test of the original hypothesis.",
